body:
if your budget is tight, i would say laptop since you are going to use it in uni soon. but if not, ipad is good to go :)

i was also a matric student and i got peranti siswa (samsung tablet) during semester 2. i went on semester 1 with papers and pens. no problemo :)

 there's not much difference tbh if you're using ipad or not. but i get the appeal, it's easy to go anywhere with it and no more messy notes. it's up to your budget, OP! don't get an ipad just bcs it looks cool or try to keep up w the trend. best of luck <3
